From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] msvcrt: Implement the Concurrency Runtime exception classes and the reentrant and reader-writer locks.

Concurrency Runtime exception classes that were spec stubs: bad_target,
context_self_unblock, context_unblock_unbalanced,
default_scheduler_exists, improper_scheduler_reference,
invalid_link_target, invalid_operation, invalid_oversubscribe_operation,
message_not_found, nested_scheduler_missing_detach, operation_timed_out,
scheduler_not_attached, task_canceled and unsupported_os (constructors
with and without a message, and vtables), scheduler_worker_creation_error
with its HRESULT (msvcr110 and later), and the members of
details::_ReentrantLock and details::_ReaderWriterLock. msvcr100, msvcr110,
msvcr120 (msvcr120_app forwards) and concrt140.
---
